{"id":"prueba","lemma":"prueba","pos":"noun","rank":414,"glosses":["proof; evidence (usually in the plural)","an examination, test, or quiz","a trial; an ordeal; an audition"],"ipa":"/ˈpɾweba/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pruebas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ec/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Millars-prueba.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me gustaría ver alguna prueba.","en":"I'd like to see some proof.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515178","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},null]},{"text":"Hoy tendremos una prueba.","en":"We're going to have a test today.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735760","words":[{"g":"today, tonight"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"No tengo ninguna prueba de ello.","en":"I have no proof of that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459913","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"nobody","l":"ninguno"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it"}]},{"text":"Prueba esta salsa.","en":"Try this sauce.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/441255","words":[null,{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"sauce, gravy"}]},{"text":"Eso no prueba nada.","en":"That proves nothing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448328","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"no / not"},null,{"g":"nothing"}]}]}